{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
		"name": "Task Management API",
		"description": "Postman collection for Task Management REST API.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Register a user\n2. Login to get JWT token (auto-saved to variable)\n3. Use Task endpoints (token is auto-attached)\n\n**Variables:**\n- `base_url`: Server base URL (default: http://localhost:8080)\n- `token`: JWT token (auto-set after Login)\n- `task_id`: Task ID (auto-set after Create Task)\n- `user_id`: User ID (auto-set after Register)",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "base_url",
			"value": "http://localhost:8080",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "token",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "task_id",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "user_id",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Auth",
			"description": "Authentication endpoints: Register and Login.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Register",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', jsonData.data.id);",
									"    pm.test('Register successful', function () {",
									"        pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.eql('success');",
									"    });",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"testuser\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/register",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "register"]
						},
						"description": "Register a new user.\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `username` (string, required)\n- `password` (string, required)\n\n**Auto-saves:** `user_id` variable on success."
					},
					"response": [
						{
							"name": "201 - Success",
							"originalRequest": {
								"method": "POST",
								"header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
								"body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"testuser\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"},
								"url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/register", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "register"]}
							},
							"status": "Created",
							"code": 201,
							"body": "{\n    \"status\": \"success\",\n    \"data\": {\n        \"id\": \"uuid-here\",\n        \"username\": \"testuser\"\n    }\n}"
						},
						{
							"name": "409 - Conflict (User exists)",
							"originalRequest": {
								"method": "POST",
								"header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
								"body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"testuser\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"},
								"url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/register", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "register"]}
							},
							"status": "Conflict",
							"code": 409,
							"body": "{\n    \"status\": \"error\",\n    \"code\": \"CONFLICT\",\n    \"message\": \"Resource already exists\",\n    \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-18T12:00:00Z\"\n}"
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "Login",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', jsonData.data.token);",
									"    pm.test('Login successful, token saved', function () {",
									"        pm.expect(jsonData.data.token).to.be.a('string');",
									"    });",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"testuser\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/login",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "login"]
						},
						"description": "Login with existing credentials to receive a JWT token.\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `username` (string, required)\n- `password` (string, required)\n\n**Auto-saves:** `token` variable on success. All subsequent protected requests will use this token automatically."
					},
					"response": [
						{
							"name": "200 - Success",
							"originalRequest": {
								"method": "POST",
								"header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
								"body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"testuser\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"},
								"url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "login"]}
							},
							"status": "OK",
							"code": 200,
							"body": "{\n    \"status\": \"success\",\n    \"data\": {\n        \"token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...\"\n    }\n}"
						},
						{
							"name": "401 - Unauthorized",
							"originalRequest": {
								"method": "POST",
								"header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
								"body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"testuser\",\n    \"password\": \"wrongpassword\"\n}"},
								"url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "login"]}
							},
							"status": "Unauthorized",
							"code": 401,
							"body": "{\n    \"status\": \"error\",\n    \"code\": \"UNAUTHORIZED\",\n    \"message\": \"Unauthorized access\",\n    \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-18T12:00:00Z\"\n}"
						}
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "Tasks",
			"description": "Task CRUD endpoints. All require JWT authentication via Bearer token.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Create Task",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('task_id', jsonData.data.id);",
									"    pm.test('Task created successfully', function () {",
									"        pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.eql('success');",
									"        pm.expect(jsonData.data.title).to.be.a('string');",
									"        pm.expect(jsonData.data.status).to.eql('pending');",
									"    });",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{token}}"
							},
							{
								"key": "Idempotency-Key",
								"value": "{{$guid}}",
								"description": "Optional. Set a unique key to prevent duplicate task creation. Uses Postman dynamic variable {{$guid}} to auto-generate a UUID.",
								"disabled": false
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"title\": \"Implement Login Feature\",\n    \"description\": \"Create login page with JWT authentication\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/tasks",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "tasks"]
						},
						"description": "Create a new task. The task is automatically assigned to the authenticated user.\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `title` (string, required)\n- `description` (string, optional)\n\n**Headers:**\n- `Idempotency-Key` (optional): UUID to prevent duplicate creation on retries.\n\n**Auto-saves:** `task_id` variable on success."
					},
					"response": [
						{
							"name": "201 - Created",
							"originalRequest": {
								"method": "POST",
								"header": [
									{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
									{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"},
									{"key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "unique-key-123"}
								],
								"body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n    \"title\": \"Implement Login Feature\",\n    \"description\": \"Create login page with JWT authentication\"\n}"},
								"url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/tasks", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "tasks"]}
							},
							"status": "Created",
							"code": 201,
							"body": "{\n    \"status\": \"success\",\n    \"data\": {\n        \"id\": \"uuid-here\",\n        \"title\": \"Implement Login Feature\",\n        \"description\": \"Create login page with JWT authentication\",\n        \"status\": \"pending\",\n        \"assignee_id\": \"user-uuid\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-09-18T12:00:00Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-18T12:00:00Z\"\n    }\n}"
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "Create Task (Idempotency Test - Same Key)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{token}}"
							},
							{
								"key": "Idempotency-Key",
								"value": "test-idempotency-key-001",
								"description": "Use the SAME key to test idempotency. First call creates, second call returns cached response."
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"title\": \"Idempotency Test Task\",\n    \"description\": \"Send this request twice with the same Idempotency-Key. The second request should return the same response without creating a duplicate.\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/tasks",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "tasks"]
						},
						"description": "**Idempotency Test:** Send this request multiple times with the same `Idempotency-Key` header value. Only the first request creates a task; subsequent requests return the cached original response."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "List Tasks",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/tasks?limit=10&page=1",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "tasks"],
							"query": [
								{
									"key": "limit",
									"value": "10",
									"description": "Number of items per page (default: 10)"
								},
								{
									"key": "page",
									"value": "1",
									"description": "Page number (default: 1)"
								},
								{
									"key": "status",
									"value": "pending",
									"description": "Filter by status: pending, in-progress, completed",
									"disabled": true
								},
								{
									"key": "title",
									"value": "Login",
									"description": "Filter by title (partial match / LIKE search)",
									"disabled": true
								}
							]
						},
						"description": "List all tasks assigned to the authenticated user with pagination and optional filters.\n\n**Query Parameters:**\n- `limit` (int, default: 10) - Items per page\n- `page` (int, default: 1) - Page number\n- `status` (string, optional) - Filter: `pending`, `in-progress`, `completed`\n- `title` (string, optional) - Partial title search"
					},
					"response": [
						{
							"name": "200 - Success",
							"originalRequest": {
								"method": "GET",
								"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
								"url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/tasks?limit=10&page=1", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "tasks"], "query": [{"key": "limit", "value": "10"}, {"key": "page", "value": "1"}]}
							},
							"status": "OK",
							"code": 200,
							"body": "{\n    \"status\": \"success\",\n    \"data\": [\n        {\n            \"id\": \"uuid-here\",\n            \"title\": \"Implement Login Feature\",\n            \"description\": \"Create login page\",\n            \"status\": \"pending\",\n            \"assignee_id\": \"user-uuid\",\n            \"created_at\": \"2026-09-18T12:00:00Z\",\n            \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-18T12:00:00Z\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"meta\": {\n        \"total\": 1,\n        \"page\": 1,\n        \"limit\": 10\n    }\n}"
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Task Detail",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/tasks/{{task_id}}",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "tasks", "{{task_id}}"]
						},
						"description": "Get detailed information for a specific task by ID.\n\n**Path Parameters:**\n- `id` (string, required) - Task UUID"
					},
					"response": [
						{
							"name": "200 - Success",
							"originalRequest": {
								"method": "GET",
								"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
								"url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/tasks/{{task_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "tasks", "{{task_id}}"]}
							},
							"status": "OK",
							"code": 200,
							"body": "{\n    \"status\": \"success\",\n    \"data\": {\n        \"id\": \"uuid-here\",\n        \"title\": \"Implement Login Feature\",\n        \"description\": \"Create login page with JWT authentication\",\n        \"status\": \"pending\",\n        \"assignee_id\": \"user-uuid\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-09-18T12:00:00Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-18T12:00:00Z\"\n    }\n}"
						},
						{
							"name": "404 - Not Found",
							"originalRequest": {
								"method": "GET",
								"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
								"url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/tasks/invalid-id", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "tasks", "invalid-id"]}
							},
							"status": "Not Found",
							"code": 404,
							"body": "{\n    \"status\": \"error\",\n    \"code\": \"NOT_FOUND\",\n    \"message\": \"Resource not found\",\n    \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-18T12:00:00Z\"\n}"
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "Update Task",
					"request": {
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{token}}"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"title\": \"Implement Login Feature - Updated\",\n    \"description\": \"Updated description with OAuth support\",\n    \"status\": \"in-progress\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/tasks/{{task_id}}",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "tasks", "{{task_id}}"]
						},
						"description": "Update an existing task. Only fields provided in the body will be updated (partial update).\n\n**Path Parameters:**\n- `id` (string, required) - Task UUID\n\n**Request Body (all optional):**\n- `title` (string)\n- `description` (string)\n- `status` (string) - `pending`, `in-progress`, `completed`"
					},
					"response": [
						{
							"name": "200 - Success",
							"originalRequest": {
								"method": "PUT",
								"header": [
									{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
									{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
								],
								"body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n    \"status\": \"in-progress\"\n}"},
								"url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/tasks/{{task_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "tasks", "{{task_id}}"]}
							},
							"status": "OK",
							"code": 200,
							"body": "{\n    \"status\": \"success\",\n    \"data\": {\n        \"id\": \"uuid-here\",\n        \"title\": \"Implement Login Feature - Updated\",\n        \"description\": \"Updated description\",\n        \"status\": \"in-progress\",\n        \"assignee_id\": \"user-uuid\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-09-18T12:00:00Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-18T12:05:00Z\"\n    }\n}"
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "Assign Task (DB Transaction)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{token}}"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"assignee_id\": \"target-user-uuid-here\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/tasks/{{task_id}}/assign",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "tasks", "{{task_id}}", "assign"]
						},
						"description": "Assign a task to another user. This operation runs inside a **database transaction** that:\n1. Updates the task's assignee\n2. Creates a log entry in `task_logs` table\n3. Mocks a notification\n\nIf any step fails, all changes are **rolled back**.\n\n**Path Parameters:**\n- `id` (string, required) - Task UUID\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `assignee_id` (string, required) - The UUID of the user to assign the task to"
					},
					"response": [
						{
							"name": "200 - Success",
							"originalRequest": {
								"method": "POST",
								"header": [
									{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
									{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
								],
								"body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n    \"assignee_id\": \"target-user-uuid\"\n}"},
								"url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/tasks/{{task_id}}/assign", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "tasks", "{{task_id}}", "assign"]}
							},
							"status": "OK",
							"code": 200,
							"body": "{\n    \"status\": \"success\",\n    \"data\": {\n        \"message\": \"Task assigned successfully\"\n    }\n}"
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "Delete Task",
					"request": {
						"method": "DELETE",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/tasks/{{task_id}}",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "tasks", "{{task_id}}"]
						},
						"description": "Delete a task by ID. Only the task owner (assignee) can delete it.\n\n**Path Parameters:**\n- `id` (string, required) - Task UUID"
					},
					"response": [
						{
							"name": "200 - Success",
							"originalRequest": {
								"method": "DELETE",
								"header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
								"url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/tasks/{{task_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "tasks", "{{task_id}}"]}
							},
							"status": "OK",
							"code": 200,
							"body": "{\n    \"status\": \"success\"\n}"
						}
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}
